cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this atlas or its data bundle, please cite it as below."
title: "云岭之上：香格里拉高原葡萄园图集 (Above the Clouds: A Shangri-La Vineyard Atlas)"
abstract: >-
  A static data narrative of high-altitude vineyards in Deqin County, Yunnan.
  Four conflicting published area figures are kept side by side rather than
  averaged; maps and the 6.5 °C/km lapse-rate illustration are explicitly
  schematic; all figures carry a year and a clickable public source.
authors:
